window.products.push({"id":1065067,"name":"The Declaration of Independence Replica of Historical Document Genuine Parchment Custom Made Real Wood Dark Mahogany with Black Trim Frame (28 x 34)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hIMY0SNTL._AC_.jpg","description":"A lovely framed American History Memorabilia for someone special, or a perfect present for any age or taste! Each hand-finished genuine parchment is carefully mounted on a sturdy mat board to keep it flat and smooth, and then framed just for you. The solid wood frame comes with a metal sawtooth hanger, clear round bumpers on the back of the frame to protect walls from scratches and dents, and is ready to be hung. The only thing you need is space on the wall. Shop Accent Piece’s large crafted store collection to decorate, accessorize and personalize your home, office, or place of business today. Add something special to a blank wall or any space that needs a lift. Framed prints remain in good condition for years to come. The Declaration of Independence is the most famous document in U.S. history. It was drafted in an act of desperation. The Revolutionary War was a year old, but the freedoms the American colonists were fighting for appeared remote. The Continental Congress appointed Thomas Jefferson to draft a formal declaration of total independence from Britain. In Philadelphia, on July 4, 1776, Congress adopted the Declaration and the United States of America was born. This beautiful presentation display features an original hand-finished genuine parchment and dense multi-layer picture mounting with custom carved matting design. It is showcased in a double mat, professionally framed in a real wood frame and topped with premium clear framing acrylic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hIMY0SNTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Historical Documents","source_asin":"B004FT2Q5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004FT2Q5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004FT2Q5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
