window.products.push({"id":1065211,"name":"FEESPEC Digital Coffee Scale with Timer, Espresso Scale Weight Grams for The Pour Over, Brewing and Drip Coffee, 3kg/0.1g Accuracy White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J4c5QJZGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Great Choice - The FEESPEC Scale with timer has everything you need for coffee and espresso. Make the perfect pour-over on a scale that has a quick refresh rate and registers weight down to the tenth of a gram. Precise Measurements and Quick Weighing Response Times - This digital coffee scale can show you the measurements in almost real-time and precisely measure weight to 0.1 gram. It’s ideal for espresso and v60 pour over coffee. Easy to Use – This coffee scale includes an integrated timer that allows you to take more control of your brew. The TARE button is used for tare calculation, which makes it easy to read the ingredients accurately. And you can even rely on the auto-off function, which will turn the scale off to save power after 2 minutes of inactivity. Multi-Scenario Use – The espresso scale is 7.2 x 5.1 x 1.2 inches, and since it is specially designed for coffee, it fits the drip tray and standard portafilter of most espresso machines. It also can be used in various scenarios, including coffee brewing, cooking, baking, milk powder, and meal preparation. Intimate service - A heat-resistant silicone pad is provided, making the coffee weight scale easy to keep clean and non-slip properties. We have industry experts ready to help you solve any problems related to coffee scales. Please feel free to contact us if you have any further questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J4c5QJZGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEESPEC","source_asin":"B0BDYB8RRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDYB8RRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDYB8RRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
