window.products.push({"id":1065389,"name":"Comodo Original Luxury Body Pillow CMD9900LS High-End Class Dakimakura Pillow [Made in Japan] (20 x 63 inch (160cm x 50cm))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wybpoTdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product dimensions: 160cm x 50cm x 18cm (20 x 63 x 7 inch)  Packed dimensions: 46cm x 40cm x 25cm Product weight: 2,630g Fabric: polyester / urethane (blend ratio: not disclosed)  Fabric: 2-way tricot (special order Japanese fabric)  Batting: polyester, silicone (Japanese fabric from Toray and Teijin)   【Fluffiness】 Features a unique 2-way weave that makes for a stretchier tricot fabric.  We started with the planning stage, when we special-ordered material from the manufacturer that achieved the bi-directional stretch and feeling of softness we sought.  Designed to eliminate to the fullest extent possible slippage between the pillow and pillowcase, the zippers used are from the always-reliable YKK.  The zipper design will not disturb the body pillow and is strong and durable.    【Commitment to the finest in comfort】 Made from a special-order 2-way tricot fabric that is not only of excellent quality, but will withstand everyday wear and tear. Our special-order fabric has a brushed finish. Compared to the CMD9000, it collects a bit more dust and dirt, but it has a much improved feeling of comfort. Use without worry: it can be easily cleaned with lukewarm water to keep it fresh. Perfectly safe for families with children.    【Compatible with anime-style pillowcases】 Comodo’s special-order fabric has been refined over the years in collaboration with textile manufacturers.  It decreases to the fullest extent possible any slippage when putting it over your existing anime pillowcase.  Featuring a unique proportion of polyester and silicone batting, our body pillows have been repeatedly innovated on to achieve a fill technique that offers excellent rebound and restores the fabric to its original shape. In order to ensure that our body pillows retain their resilience and comfort, we continuously draw on feedback from customers to improve them every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wybpoTdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comodo","source_asin":"B07DFJZY8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DFJZY8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DFJZY8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
