window.products.push({"id":1065555,"name":"fancy-fix Decorative Privacy Vinyl Glass Window Film 35.4in * 59in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gP3KfDR3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Add some pizzazz to your windows with our Decorative Privacy Vinyl Glass Window Film! This static clean window film makes a wonderful addition to any living area, bathroom, office or place of business thanks to its sleek design and soft white color. Our premium glass window film serves multiple purposes! The unique fabrication of the vinyl film provides a touch of privacy and reduces glare while still letting a bit of sunlight flow through the window. It's also incredibly simple to apply in addition to being easily removable as it self-adheres and does not require any adhesive. What Included: 1 roll 35.4-inch by 59-inch window film 1 PIECE step by step Window Film Installation Instruction  Select the size of roll needed for your window and then click ' Add to Cart ' place your order today! Quick Tips: Step 01. Clean glass Step 02.Wet glass with soapy water(or just clear water also work well) Step 03. Remove from backing protect sheet (which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass) Step 04. Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands Step 05. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Removal and Storage for Re-use To remove, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly leaving no residue.? When not in use, window film must be replaced and stored on the original backing paper. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing paper. About fancy-fix Fancy-fix team has been in printing production line for more than 20 years. We perseveres with its unchanged idea since the first day of its birth, devoting our life to developing self-adhesive & adhesive free products in homing trend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gP3KfDR3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fancy-fix","source_asin":"B00RZ1XLZI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RZ1XLZI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RZ1XLZI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
