window.products.push({"id":1065923,"name":"Tribe Glare Organic Cotton Bread Bag - Reusable, Premium Bread Bag - Bakery Supplies and Food Storage Solutions - 100% Recyclable and Sustainable - Ze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkBPb-HvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞 Eco-Friendly & Reusable: Manufactured from organic cotton, this zero waste homemade bread storage bag comes from the earth and will return to earth.Replace your paper and plastic bags with these 100% cotton reusable bag, which is natural and chemical free. 🍩 Freezer Safe & Easy to Clean: With the fresh-keeping linen inside, The freezer bags can lock out freezer burn while keeping food fresh and full of taste for a short time.Perfect for bread, fruits, and vegetables.Simple to use and can be hand washed, and then line dried out of direct sunlight, great for bread storage and farm market shopping. 🍔 Multi-purpose Use: This bread loaf bags are not only your perfect choice to store your homemade bread, but also can be as bread keepers for bread purchased from your local artisan bakery. Buckle Bag can be used as produce bags to put your fruit and vegetables in when going to the grocery store or farmers market. 🍪 Large Size: The bread bag come in a large size to fit your homemade sourdough, bread machine loaves, oval loaves or long baguettes. Unique Gift: This bakery bag are 100% recyclable, sustainable and vegan-friendly. Not only great as party or wedding favors or as adorable gift bags, but also as gifts for birthdays, Christmas and other holidays. 🎃 Important: Our bread freezer bags feature a unique double lining and are specially designed for freezer safety! These reusable homemade bread bags are not designed to extend the life of bread. Most freshly baked breads start to go bad after 24 hours because they usually contain no preservatives. The first two or three days of baking at a bakery are all the fresh bread you can really expect. Bread will keep for up to three months in a frost-free fridge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkBPb-HvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OHYGGE","source_asin":"B0892K4XMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892K4XMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892K4XMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
