window.products.push({"id":1065925,"name":"Boho Floral Shower Curtain,Bohemian Vintage Flower Shower Curtain,Beautiful Flowers & Leaves Spring Bathroom Decoration,Boho Chic Colorful Print Fabri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DdHVgyLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About \"KAFFUL\" Brand KAFFUL is a gathering of the minds which from a group of people who insist on integrating art into life.As manufacturers of digital printed home textiles, we follow current trends and bring you the latest home fashion.KAFFUL Shower Curtain, perfectly decorate your room,a fashionable and beautiful gift to your friends or relatives.We hope to give you a wonderful life and add some fun. Farmhouse & Rustic Style This vintage floral shower curtain is matched with the fresh rural style bathroom to create a fresh and natural rural style.Vivid colors echo the tones of the retro country. The color of the bathroom matches the color of the shower curtain to create a rustic country style bathroom. Bohemian Style & Floral Flower Pattern Bohemian Style & Floral Flower Pattern add vitality to your modern bathrooms,so that you can still feel the freshness and beauty of nature while bathing.The boho flower shower curtain in colorful retro flowers print is suitable for any bathroom furniture. Easy to Hang 12 Metal Grommets and 12 plastic hooks (as a gift) make this flower shower curtain easy to install and convenient for your use.Bottom weighted hem to keeps perfect drape; Within a few minutes to make a magic transformation to your bathroom. High-Quality Material This Colorful Vintage Floral shower curtain is made of premium polyester, has a good waterproof and dry quickly effect. Featuring vivid colors,crisp lines and delicate hemming, Perfect for creating a comfortable lifestyle. Care Instructions: Machine washable: Wash it in cold water. Ironing: low temperature. Do not tumble dry, do not bleach, do not dry clean. Service: KAFFUL insists that user experience is the highest priority, promising \"90-day unpacked unconditional return\" policy .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DdHVgyLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAFFUL","source_asin":"B08VMP93RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VMP93RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VMP93RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1065926,"name":"FLOWORLD Olive Tree Artificial Indoor 4FT Tall Faux Olive Plant Potted Olive Silk Tree Large Fake Olive Tree in Pot Green House Plants for Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nm-5swhsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Highly Simulated Design: People might hesitate to opt for artificial fake plants because, as the name suggest they look fake and unreal. However, our olive tree artificial looks natural and realistic that is hard to distinguish them from real plants(leaves,branches&olives). We aim to allow you to enjoy a natural visual Spa. All Season Green: Our faux olive plants are evergreen and do not change their appearance, color, or shed leaves due to weather fluctuations, not affected by seasonal changes. This indoor home decor artificial tree will give you the same perky and lively feel to your living room, kitchen, or dining room all year round. Premium Quality: The material used in making this olive silk plant is long-lasting, Safe and of advanced quality. They are water resistant due to the resilient coating applied to the leaves. And its base is made of solid cement which it's not easy to be knocked down by children or pets. Sturdy and Adjustable: When the artificial fake tree is taken out of the box, Simply bend, separate, and fluff the branches and leaves to achieve desired height and fullness. The tree in the pot can be placed into a larger planter. No Maintenance Required: Free yourself from the responsibility and use artificial tree that require less care and attention. No fertilizers are required as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nm-5swhsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLOWORLD","source_asin":"B0943WLRX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943WLRX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943WLRX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
