window.products.push({"id":1065980,"name":"HOMCOM 3' Tall Lit Full Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with Realistic Branches, 60 LED and 227 Tips, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81atZnc+qPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SERIOUSLY NO-HASSLE: If you're looking for a pre-lit artificial Christmas tree that holds its shape and is a safer option for your family, look no further than this three-foot artificial Christmas tree. No more crowded farms (yech), no more allergies (phew), no fires, no watering, no needles, you get the idea. MAKE FLUFFING FUN: The only time you're really spending is fluffing the tree, which can be a family-friendly way to decorate and share some hot chocolate, or make it a game: race against the clock, compete to see who fluffs the most, create an obstacle course…the options are nearly endless. MORE AMBIENCE IS BETTER: A flame-retardant realistic Christmas tree is going to give some extra peace-of-mind in case you have to put your tree next to your fireplace. Of course, it's great ambience on its own, but a fireplace...I mean, come on. EASY, EASY, EASY: Here's where the rubber meets the road: you get a slim cardboard box (easy storage). You get it to put together (easy assembly). You get a lightweight and strong base. Even though it's a fake Christmas tree, we've got you covered start to finish. ARTIFICIAL CHRISTMAS TREE INFORMATION: Overall tree dimensions (including base): Φ 34.75\" x 35.5\" H\". Tip Count: 227. Light Type: LED. Light Count: 60. You'll spend about 25-30 minutes fluffing this tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81atZnc+qPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B09GM91CMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1065980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GM91CMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GM91CMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
