window.products.push({"id":1066000,"name":"Paincco Tall Airtight Food Storage Containers, 4 Piece [6.5L/5.9QT] Kitchen & Pantry Storage Canisters for Cereal, Spaghetti & Flour, Include 20 Label","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uzREzFDmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superior Bundle - This set comes with 4 pieces large food storage containers (6.5L/5.9quart), 20 chalkboard labels and 1 marker pen, allowing you to organize your kitchen and pantry like never before. Clear containers makes it easy to keep track of how much food you have left. Keep Food Fresh - The lid of the airtight food storage container is designed with a 4-sided lock and a silicone sealing ring, which is securely sealed and not easy to leak in order to effectively protect the freshness of the food for longer and allow you to have a healthy life. Bpa Free & Food Grade Material - Our pantry storage containers are made of durable plastic and BPA Free material, which is healthy and environmentally friendly. Our plastic storage containers is not as heavy as glass, but the clear container allows you to see at a glance what is in it, and it is convenient to take out when you are out for a picnic. Versatile Containers - These kitchen storage containers are suitable for storing flour, sugar, rice, grain, chips, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea. You can enjoy the deliciousness of the fresh food at any meals. Stackable & Saving Space - These durable food storage organizer are specially designed to maximize space. They can be stacked and easily placed in the refrigerator, freezer or cupboard, so that your kitchen is no longer mess and has a clean and hygienic environment. Smooth surface and removable silicone seal make it easy to clean and reuse with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uzREzFDmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paincco","source_asin":"B08PZ5QGQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1066000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PZ5QGQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PZ5QGQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
